/v1/","context":{"app_id":4344260,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4344260","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:40:40Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5122500","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1846651706674499","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.013 DEMO Patch","summary":"OptionsA brightness slider has been added to adjust the game's brightness.An option has been added to enable or disable floating damage numbers.An option has been added to select the game's difficulty.Bug FixesFixed several character movement issues.Fixed several issues with Minor Healing Boxes spawning. Achievements- The requirements for unlocking the Corrupted Fist achievement have been changed.Floating Damage NumbersDamage indicators have arrived in Warped Point!From now on, you'll be able to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T14:40:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1846018067938847","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.012 DEMO Patch","summary":"Beta Patch 0.012MapSeveral areas of the map have been modified to make them more accessible and prevent skips.A new small healing box has been added.More ammo and healing boxes have been added throughout the map.EnemiesSpiritIts charged attack can now be parried.The knockback strength of its attack has been reduced.NoctisSpoiler AlertCorrupted Dagger damage has been reduced.Plasma Dagger damage has been increased.Jump attack damage has been increased.Corruption effect damage has been reduced by ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T16:33:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938847","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1846018067932976","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.011 DEMO Patch","summary":"Difficulty Adjustment Patch:Adjusted Cave Combat Area 1.Reduced damage dealt by certain enemies.Text and translation fixes (thanks to qdx_xd for helping with the corrections).","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T11:18:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932976","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1846018067932533","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Warped Point Demo Now!","summary":"The Warped Point Demo Is Finally Here!The day has finally come! The Warped Point demo is now available on Steam, completely free to play.You can finally step into this world and discover for the first time what I've been working on all this time. Explore the unknown, master your weapons, and face the dangers that await you in the Void.I want to thank everyone who has shown interest in the project, followed its development, and helped it reach this point. It means a lot to me to finally be able t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T08:17:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932533","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1845383656396781","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"announcement","title":"The Warped Point demo is finally here!","summary":"Yes, it's happening.After talking about a possible demo for so long, I can finally announce that the Warped Point demo will be available to play this Friday, October 9th.It's been a long journey, and there's still a lot left to do, but this is the first step towards letting you experience the world I've been building for so long.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T15:12:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396781","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1840944183786278","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"announcement","title":"Warped Point's First Trailer","summary":"After a long wait, we can finally show you the first official trailer for the game. This trailer showcases the upcoming free DEMO of Warped Point, so it doesn't represent the full content of the final game, but it does feature its core mechanics and the essence of the experience.I hope you enjoy it!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T14:55:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786278","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1836506165580622","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #3 - Combat Showcase","summary":"Welcome to the third official Warped Point development post.This time, I won't be explaining too much, because the video speaks for itself.Today I want to showcase the potential of Warped Point and its combat system. For the first time, you'll get to see raw gameplay footage, including fights against regular enemies and a preview of the game's first boss.Everything you'll see is still a work in progress. The boss, for example, doesn't have its final arena yet, and there are still visual effects,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T13:05:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165580622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1830797770237199","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #2 – Mythic Weapons and Armor","summary":"Welcome to the second official development post for Warped Point.I’ve talked several times about how Warped Point is a fast-paced combat game with adaptive enemies… but what about you? How do you actually fight? And what about the weapons?Today we’re going to take a look at some top-tier weapons and a rather special piece of armor. Tool TiersFirst of all, let’s talk about tiers, both for weapons and tools. Currently, there are a total of 5 (with provisional names):Common (Gray) - Rare (Blue) - S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T19:18:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770237199","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4344260-1824644522843790","game_id":"steam-4344260","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #1 – New Mechanic: Parry and Enemy Redesign","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to the first official development update for Warped Point.From now on, Steam will be the main platform where I share the project's progress. I’ll continue using Twitter to announce new posts and share smaller updates. We also have an official YouTube channel where I’ll be posting development-related content.Current Development StatusMy main goal right now is to make the first section of the game fully playable so I can release a public demo.This demo won’t just be a t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-15T17:41:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522843790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4344260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4344260":"2026-10-26T02:11:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4344260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5122500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4344260","app_id":4344260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"da9ed1c77b825541ce74e39b8e5380164b9357658ed567d6ac4aa7987e4b409e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Explore the unknown, master your weapons, and face the corruption and dangers that lurk while you embrace the chaos.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Warped Point, a mysterious world on the brink of collapse.","publishers":[{"name":"Marc &quot;selempo&quot; Mengual"}],"developers":[{"name":"Marc &quot;selempo&quot; Mengual"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"WARPED POINT — Official Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1786976354","trailer_category":0,"microtrail